The well now glows with a red light from below. The demon looks very expectant.

> cast death on demon
The spellbook opens itself to the right page, and you read aloud the complicated
words of the death spell.

A red glow gathers around the demon. For a moment it burns from within, so that
you can see the bones through the skin, and then the whole shape collapses in on
itself and goes up in smoke.

Where the demon stood, your mentor stands in its place, blinking, himself again
for the space of a single breath. Then his knees give way and he falls dead to
the floor.

The room begins to come apart. Your senses will not hold still, strange visions
arrive and go again, and the crypt seems to be draining away before your eyes.

