> cast heal on istar
The spellbook opens itself to the right page, and you read aloud the complicated
words of the healing spell.

The spell goes out of you and finds nothing at all to work on. Healing is for
the living, and it will not cross the line he has just crossed. You will need
something a great deal longer and more complicated than anything in this book.

The room is changing and vanishing.

> cast resurrection on istar
You read aloud the complicated words of the resurrection spell.

For a long moment nothing happens at all. Then a faint colour comes back into
his cheeks, and a breath, and then another, until his chest is rising and
falling as steadily as your own. He is unconscious, but he is alive!

The room is changing and vanishing.

