> l
The Crypt
The chamber has the look of a heathen temple. Obsidian pillars rise into the
darkness, carved with blasphemous runes that seem to shift whenever you are not
looking straight at them. A great stone altar stands at the centre, stained dark
by old rituals, and four glowing pedestals surround it. There are no exits.

On the floor lies your mentor. He is unconscious, but breathing again.

The last of the visions gives way to a scene that stays where it is put. You are
standing in a meadow in a green deciduous wood, with your mentor asleep in the
grass beside you. The sun is warm, and it is a perfect day for going fishing.

Press space to continue.


The earth is saved, and your mentor's soul is restored. All's well that ends
well.


